Package: nosZviz
Title: Publication-Ready Visualization of NosZRef nosZ Profiling
        Results
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Baoshan", family = "Zhang",
           email = "2642101135@qq.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive, one-stop visualization toolkit designed
    specifically for the output directory of the NosZRef pipeline
    (<https://github.com/ZhangBaoshan668/NosZRef>). It parses every
    intermediate and merged result file produced by NosZRef (branch-level
    RPKM and read counts, OTU tables, rarefied tables, seven-rank
    taxonomic profiles, alpha diversity indices, rarefaction curves,
    beta diversity distance matrices, and co-occurrence network
    topology) and turns them into more than sixty publication-quality
    figures covering gene abundance partitioning, taxonomic composition,
    alpha diversity, beta diversity ordination, differential abundance,
    network topology, and - new in 0.2.0 - a clade-ecology narrative
    layer: clade-resolved nested composition, clade II/I abundance
    ratios, LEfSe-style and indicator-taxa analyses, taxa dendrograms,
    and environmental association figures (RDA/CCA/db-RDA, envfit,
    alpha-environment correlation, taxa-environment networks) together
    with a one-click HTML/PDF report.
